window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A second chance at love? Hell, no.<br> <br> After getting my heart ripped out last season on Hitched, I finally get the chance to be the one in charge. I’m the new bachelor, and I get my pick of twelve smoking hot supernatural girls. My tiger and I plan on having the time of our lives.<br> <br> No commitment, no heartbreak, just casual hook-ups with no strings attached.<br> Sound too good to be true?<br> Damn, right it is.<br> <br> On the first night, an unexpected twist has me sharing the girls with an old friend. And we all know nothing good can come from forcing a possessive tiger to share. Especially when I start to develop real feelings for some of the bachelorettes.<br> <br> As if two bachelors weren’t bad enough, the drama only gets worse when contestants become targeted in a secret plot for revenge.<br> <br> And I thought the elimination ceremonies were going to be the worst part of the show…<br> <br> Forget having fun, I just want to make it out of this season alive.</p> <p><b>Start this steamy and thrilling second chance, new adult paranormal romance full of tension, mystery, and intrigue in a tiger shifter's search for true love ♥</b></p> <p><i>***Author's note: Sweet Temptation is an ADULT paranormal romance with some dark themes, possessive males, and adult language. It was originally published on Kindle Vella as Hitched Live (Season Two). It is set within the world of Azar, along with (in listening order) Hitched, Darkblood Academy, Royally Hitched, Darkblood Prison, Wolfish, Vampish, Of Gods and Wolves, and the Hitched Live series (see below) but it's not necessary to listen to the other series first to enjoy this one.</i><br> <br> The Hitched Live Series (Season One - Aspen's story)<br> Sweet Revenge<br> Wicked Games<br> Savage Love<br> <br> The Hitched Live Series (Season Two - Deacon's story)<br> Sweet Temptation<br> Dark Desire<br> True Love</p>"; 
